{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":511126,\"title\":\"One Police Plaza\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A veteran New York City Police Lieutenant's investigation of a woman's murder uncovers corruption in high places.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yZVnV7XbvckuxBRNEXmyB5gKra9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1986,\"runtime\":92,\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jerry Jameson\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":52094,\"name\":\"Jerry Jameson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4Dv01iWpgrWOgolZDk4LKVLxp34.jpg\"},{\"id\":129317,\"name\":\"Robert Conrad\",\"character\":\"Lt. Daniel B. Malone\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9ubtqzRUVv1rN368SsNbdYuHp3.jpg\"},{\"id\":10477,\"name\":\"George Dzundza\",\"character\":\"Det. Gustav Stamm\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wmnQQn0dFygl90M2N8tlWlpGHzV.jpg\"},{\"id\":65508,\"name\":\"James Olson\",\"character\":\"Whitney Zangline\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/poeGcRZH9GXvNCfqQn66STpMqhz.jpg\"},{\"id\":2977,\"name\":\"Jamey Sheridan\",\"character\":\"Det. Bo Davis\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qLyAVsxSWgLwvVRDtvTednO6a75.jpg\"},{\"id\":1221666,\"name\":\"Larry Riley\",\"character\":\"Det. Starling\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cyV2mfEHSw7rLq4BZe8B6sizPDF.jpg\"},{\"id\":52878,\"name\":\"Lisa Banes\",\"character\":\"Erica\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bSYs9z8Su9Ewg71XO8LdiNu2OwU.jpg\"},{\"id\":4887,\"name\":\"Joe Grifasi\",\"character\":\"Insp. Nicolas Zambrano\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/30c0szBZvqsk3nuOgg2A9PeSQFt.jpg\"},{\"id\":151769,\"name\":\"Stephen Joyce\",\"character\":\"Chief Dennis McQuade\",\"photo\":\"https://image.